# Read-only data mounts per project (see README, Data Mounts):
#   cp data-mounts.example data-mounts
#
# <project root>  <data path> [<data path> ...]
# Data paths are mounted read-only at the same path in the container.
# Relative data paths are taken from the project root. ~ is expanded.
#
# ~/code/myproject  /scratch/me/raw  /scratch/me/processed
# ~/code/myproject  /mnt/shared/labels
# ~/code/other      data
